{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_08",
  "title": "逝川",
  "storyCode": "AT-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cfc69320fcaa18d3f747841b831a21325e2a0f5a0e3f74dc22b8b5c4fb2ef458",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對，是我！我剛從議員大人那裡回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星熊現在在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會場？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "澪呢？澪控制住他們了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有？！她自己離開了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "線路呢？裡面的事錄下來了嗎？星熊的狀態怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……該死！趕快讓後期處理一下，把她和澪對打的場景處理成她已經徹底瘋狂的證據——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼叫來不及？！忍客入侵？！線路被駭？！處理不了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……廢物！處理不了就快點切斷訊號傳輸還有供電系統！今晚已經只剩道歉聲明要播了，訊號沒了又能怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "關鍵是絕不能讓人在我的電視台不受控制地胡說八道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂？喂？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*東國粗口*，斷線了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死的議員，什麼“要你當面解釋”，我去解釋，不就是給敵人乘虛而入的機會嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這下好了，我跟他說廢話的時候，一切都亂套了，連般若都……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冷靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是收拾殘局從頭再來嘛，沒事，這又不是第一次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先去會場阻止那群混蛋，星熊的事，議員已經點頭了，只要能在輿論上處理乾淨……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，跟你的星熊姐一起來搗亂了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星熊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天啊，我該說你勇氣可嘉呢，還是傻得可愛呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看你這一身傷。看來我的手下還不知道你已經沒用了，還在陪你玩家家酒呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你手裡的真刀是從哪位大哥手裡搶來的？告訴我，我幫你還回去，不然人家會生氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "金兵衛……你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我現在沒時間陪你玩，哲也君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你父親從小教你的那幾下刀法，作為基礎固然不錯，但要用它上陣殺敵，你還差得遠，差得太遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟是一對能被面具挑撥了關係的父子，他教你的刀法，你又能領會幾分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "挑撥？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "挑撥，是啊……挑撥……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該說的我都說完了。現在就給我滾，不然，我也不介意再更改主意，直接送你去見鐵齋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該滾去見我父親的人……是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位觀眾……大家……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是羽生、羽生……萌萌香。害怕怪談，卻又被怪談纏身的羽生萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常抱歉，在剛剛發生過那麼嚴重的放送事故之後，又來打擾大家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的粉絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌親？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的粉絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌親不是失蹤了嗎，怎麼突然又冒出來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的粉絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道剛才的警報真的是怪談？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的粉絲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那現在是……她正在怪談中……向我們所有人求助？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，如各位所見，我又站在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種荒誕的事發生在我身上好像特別正常。怪談嘛，就該是這樣的。一下子冒出來，一下子又消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是……如果我告訴大家，根本就沒有什麼怪談呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尖酸的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香？鬧失蹤就算了，還搞到滿城風雨，為了捧她金石台真的是下了血本。這次又有什麼怪談可以讓她蹭的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊蕩的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……她說怪談是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尖酸的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？她瘋了？怎麼可能？她是不是把我們當笨蛋？怪談不是每時每刻都在發生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊蕩的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她自己說的，你想看就看，不要問我啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我告訴大家，除了極少數幾個怪談跟神明有關之外，我做過的所有節目、經歷過的所有的怪談……都是編造出來的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不是假設。這是真實的謊言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "金石電視台和演藝事務所欺騙了大家。而我，儘管一直被蒙在鼓裡，也成了欺騙各位的幫兇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對於欺騙各位一事，我沒有任何藉口，願意接受大家的所有指責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生氣的母親",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是跟你說了今晚不要看電視嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雀躍的小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同學說上面在播很厲害的東西啊！你看！怪談明星親自說怪談是假的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我參與的謊言……不計其數。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就比如，一連串怪談的源頭，位於鍛冶町的“金石會青鬼”的舊居，連續讓居住者死去的兇宅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不是怪談。那是真真實實的殺人案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在此指控三船光平——金石台和演藝事務所的所有者，黑道組織金石會的實際控制人，是幕後真兇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他無端端懷疑我與他的死對頭鐵齋勾結，在我對自己身處的環境一無所知時，就已經在策劃讓我感染礦石病了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所謂“金石會的青鬼”，正是多年前代替他離開御機的人，她救了我，卻反而被誣陷為“劫持”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而後，我無意中觸及了所謂怪談背後隱藏的真相，他因此想殺人滅口，還製造我要隱退的謠言……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "惟任先生！上面已經快氣瘋了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這已經是第八道讓我們截斷直播訊號的命令了，您看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前七道我們怎麼應對的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……沒應對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不就好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你們一直抱怨我什麼。“會好的”、“會好的”，說到後來，連我自己都沒信心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，今晚有我在，就讓警察輕鬆這樣一個晚上，不必看任何人的臉色，也算是我給你們的一份臨別贈禮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……以上，就是我今晚不得不告訴大家的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來，我還想說一些題外話，一些……關於我自己的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，很多人都覺得我在節目中害怕的表現很激烈，甚至有點……做作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我希望告訴大家的是，恐懼這個詞，幾乎貫穿了羽生萌萌香迄今為止的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡固然有小時候長輩向我講了太多恐怖故事的原因，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更深的原因是，我的家鄉在後川城，以水污染聞名的後川城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那裡的恐懼從來都不是半夜在街上游蕩的殺人鬼，不是會帶來不幸的獨輪車，不是會偽裝成電梯等人進去的“地獄”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恐懼是某一天忽然臥床不起的親戚，是走路時莫名其妙地摔跤，是好像有些不適，卻不敢確定是否真的開始發麻的雙手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一切只會自然而然地發生，當你意識到的時候已經……太晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我實在太幸運了。我來到了御機，沐浴在喜愛我的、審視我的、厭惡我的目光之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的恐懼不再是病痛和死亡，而是觀眾的評判、粉絲的流失、事務所的壓力以及子虛烏有的怪談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在生命重新受到威脅的現在，回頭想想，能為這些而恐懼……多奢侈啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能為怪談害怕，其實是一種……幸福，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們不用去面對真實的危險，只需要躺在床上，為一個不知真假的故事驚聲尖叫，然後在神經從緊繃到放鬆的過程中徹底滿足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我……今後的我，恐怕無法再享受這樣的樂趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當我知道，從來都只是嚇我一跳的怪談背後其實是欺騙，是貪婪，是殺人滅口，我再也無法用那種奢侈的心態去面對它們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，從今往後，羽生萌萌香不再是怪談纏身的藝人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從今往後，羽生萌萌香與金石會旗下的演藝事務所，解除所有關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船腳邊，躺在地上的哲也已經遍體鱗傷。\n並不是斐迪亞有意要留他一命。\n事實上，他無數次想儘快了結對方，瘋狂的鬼卻總是如同不要命一般衝向他的刀尖，只為了能在被刺穿後也刺穿對方。\n一旁的螢幕中，萌萌香的言辭一句一句地灌入他的耳朵，更讓他雙手顫抖，連連失準。\n他的意圖從一擊斃命變成重傷失能，又變成儘快擺脫這個發瘋的禍害，設法收拾亂局，但哲也總能在身上多加一道傷口之後爬起來……\n而萌萌香的宣言，也已經到了尾聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "演藝的路我還會走下去，無論如何，只要我還活著，就會走下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要做的是給人帶來希望，是讓困境中的人，讓被恐懼纏身的人知道，有人曾經和你們一樣，有人能和你們感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人會把你們的故事唱出來、演出來，有人會拼盡全力，讓你們的聲音不至於悄無聲息地消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香的額頭上滑過一滴汗珠，她輕輕用手將其拂去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是說了好了不起的話啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道為什麼，說了大話之後，我突然有點害怕了。我膽子小嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛剛在想，也許我們的生活中不只怪談這一種謊言，也許這樣的謊言數不勝數，也許我們繁榮的生活……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……就建立在這些謊言之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個不知輕重的瘋女人到底在說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她知不知道一切都建立在信心之上，她知不知道，假如有人信以為真，假如這樣的恐慌擴散開來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這……就是我們的生活。在那個也許永遠不會到來的尾聲到來之前，一直持續下去的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕真的建立在謊言……不，泡泡之上，哪怕泡泡明天就會破掉，這也是我們的生活……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不得不去喜歡的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更何況，這樣的生活就算總有一天會消失，但它……很美，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕是一瞬間的美，只要深深印在心中，在破滅的那一天到來之後，它也會成為夜裡的一點難得的溫暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要說的……就這麼多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉佔用了大家寶貴的時間。我是羽生萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許……不，我相信，我們很快就會再見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "已經沒有翻盤的餘地了。\n斐迪亞呆在原地，只是木然地看著螢幕上那個人的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，你又站起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們再來一次嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "礙事的女人終於講完一長串瘋話，現在你可以再試著過來為你爹報仇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年輕的鬼搖搖晃晃地擺出架勢，而終於冷靜下來的斐迪亞已經看準了他肋間的破綻，只等他動手，就一擊取走他的性命。\n但鬼遲遲沒有出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是連我這樣的傻瓜都明白，你已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哲也轉過身去，而三船儘管臉色鐵青，卻也沒了下一步的動作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的後背亮給你了。不殺我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "突然沒心情了。我還有很多要殺的人排在你前面呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等他們全都死光，我會去找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，還有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船盯著哲也的背影，忽然冒出一句連他自己也不清楚為什麼要講的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……早些時候我對你父親講的那些話，其實是講給你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而哲也分不清三船到底是挑釁還是有什麼別的意圖，最終只是回過頭，用充血的眼睛狠狠瞪了三船一眼，然後踉踉蹌蹌地離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一切如同夢境般不真實。\n說完那一長串告白後，自己因為過度激動撲通一聲倒在了舞台上。\n後面的事情就有些模糊了……但無論如何，星熊朝樓上走去，而森內、吉星和更紗帶著自己往樓下走。\n中間似乎還有打鬥，有爆炸，但那些事情好像都發生在很遙遠很遙遠的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是哪裡？吉星？森內老闆？更紗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更紗怎麼倒在地上……睡著了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，剛才在電視台裡的時候她好像也睡過一次……難道她是很容易累倒的那種體質？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，現在要換我背著她跑了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香，你在哪裡？更紗呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們到底走到哪條巷子裡去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，終於抓住你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈、哈哈，竟然獨自把這個女人抓住了，這真是大功一件……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幸好身上帶了膠帶，這個女人是唱歌的，要是吼起來就麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒入行的時候我還憧憬什麼“忍術道具”，結果，唉，我這樣的人，能拿到的都是些破爛東西，高級的都在前輩手裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得快點向上面報告——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，我都忘了，終端的電被我故意用光了，原本想在後巷的小咖啡館裡躲一下午好好放鬆的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒想到最後竟然手到擒來抓住了這女人，我的運氣也太好了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“源石電路兵糧丸”呢？我找找看……有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忍者把“源石電路兵糧丸”——一個球形的源石電器，上面支出一根長長的線——接在自己螢幕黑漆漆的終端上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個電充得真慢啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，我把你嘴上的膠帶撕下來，你幫我唱兩句怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸噫噫啊欸嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你答應，我也不會鬆開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道嗎？那天晚上你騎著摩托車跑了之後，一直都是我們這些人在到處追你。你的家就是本大爺搜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噫唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你家真的是寒酸得要命，我還以為像你這樣的大偶像會住在豪宅，結果根本沒什麼值錢的可以偷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "話說回來，你窗邊擺的那一排又是什麼東西？該不會是什麼奇怪的戀物癖吧，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚——噗啊！咳、咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再說一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "膠帶開了？我綁的手法應該沒問題啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，也沒差啦，一個弱不禁風的偶像而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "告訴你，我不只把你窗邊上的怪東西一個個全部檢查了一遍，那棵離死不遠的植物，我也幫你剪掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "葉助是你剪斷的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“葉助”？哦，那棵還沒有雜草高的樹苗啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我啊，怎麼了？也不知道你怎麼照顧的，那根草根本沒有活路，葉子都黃到脆掉了，我才大發慈悲幫你把它剪掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也種過花。種花這種事要有耐心，最重要的是，要有無微不至的關懷和愛，懂嗎？像你這樣的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事，怎麼站起來了？這個膠帶也太爛了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對對對，你肯定會一點什麼源石技藝。你既然是阿戈爾……和水相關的那種？對對對，就是這麼回事。難怪膠帶掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對，前輩是不是說過，除了感染者以外，沒有人能徒手用源石技藝？但這樣也不對啊，總不可能是靠蠻力扯斷的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不不，你一副弱不禁風的樣子，怎麼可能徒手撕開我親手綁好的膠帶呢？肯定是源石技藝，肯定是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你也就這樣了。你下一步打算做什麼？把水噴到我的臉上嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "儘管嘴上不停挑釁，但剛入行的忍者仍然緊緊盯著萌萌香的眼睛。\n困獸猶鬥，這個女人也不例外。她會用什麼樣的源石技藝和自己拼命？霧氣？高壓水流？或許……酸液？\n不能放鬆警惕。不能因為眼前的女人是個毫無戰鬥經驗的偶像就掉以輕心。\n她的法術應該也不怎麼強，她施術時，施術單元的反應也一定很輕微。與其盯著杖尖——雖然那個東西長得像麥克風——不如緊盯眼睛。\n眼睛會出賣她心裡所想的一切。\n例如……殺意。\n呵，真是個不知輕重的女人。\n但她也就到此為止了。應該再看看，她的眼裡還能透露出什麼情報。也許是方位，或是施術的時機，還是……\n怎麼除了殺意就沒有其他的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這個念頭還沒轉過去，忍者的頭頂突然傳來一聲“噹”的悶響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "用麥克風敲頭……算什麼法術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兇手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畜生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有人心的惡魔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是我的葉助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你冷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不冷靜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它明明還沒死，你怎麼可以因為手賤，就把我的葉助——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剪掉了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "和剛剛在台上凜然綻放的姿態截然相反，萌萌香語無倫次地傾吐著恨意……\n而她手裡的麥克風，一次，又一次，帶著無比的憤怒，狠狠地敲在忍者身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "剛入行的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別、別打了，別——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要打！我要打死你這個沒人性的傢伙！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震驚的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香？你在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴怒的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在打這個混蛋！就是他剪了我的葉助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震驚的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，呃，你……沒事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴怒的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒事！我很好！我今晚要把這個害死了葉助的混蛋打成肉醬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震驚的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，那個，萌萌香，冷靜，冷靜……現在先撤退吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雨點般的毆打終於停了下來，兩個人的腳步聲漸漸遠去。\n那個震驚的聲音，是和萌萌香一起的那個吉星吧。對，是吉星把萌萌香帶走了，一定是這樣的。\n謝謝你，吉星。你真是個人如其名的好人——\n這是剛入行不久的忍者在失去意識之前沒能說出口的，最真摯的謝意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我等你很久了。這麼多年過去，還是沒有人攔得住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……別裝腔作勢了。你手下的人早就一哄而散，我到這裡來，沒有遇到任何阻礙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我的大勢已去，不知道金石會的青鬼親自登門拜訪，究竟所為何事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你是來為自己、為鐵齋尋仇，就在這裡拔刀吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊搖了搖頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的罪行已經全數暴露在你最拿手的電視上。不管你上面那位“議員大人”到底收了你多少好處，都不會再來保你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些勾結、隱瞞、來回輸送的利益，也許議員會拼命掩蓋，但我不關心這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能確定的是，那些你確實殺死的人，他們的冤屈終將昭雪，這就足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說話的口氣真像是個條子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，我的確在龍門當警察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還蠻想笑的。可惜，今晚不太能笑得出來。我之前還真的以為“龍門近衛局”只是個用來當噱頭的名字呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只不過是來完成二十年前那一步踏出之後就該完成的事情。我來斬斷跟東國的最後一點因緣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斬？怎麼斬？過去發生的一切都不會被你斬斷，宿業和因緣會永遠纏著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕你已經將那些東西纏上一圈又一圈鎖鏈，封進一個又一個箱子，它也會在你最不經意的時刻跳出來，將一切撕得粉碎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能斬的不過是我的喉嚨，就算斬了，那也只是個形式罷了，說到底，不還是洩憤嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……對，形式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我對你、對御機，已經沒有任何奢求，我只需要一個形式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寫一份絕緣書吧，昭告整個御機，星熊和御機，和金石會，和所謂的青鬼的怪談，從此再無關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的斐迪亞愣了一下，隨即神經質地笑了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門真的是把你從骨子裡變成了一個條子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過我拒絕。要讓一個人被組織除名，我們有更好的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來跟我刀劍相向，來悖逆我這個所謂的會長。不論我們中的哪個倒下，金石會都不再會有一點餘地，承認你是其中一員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你非要這麼做嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這才是完成二十年前未完成的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船環視自己的辦公室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我多少有點喜歡這裡，打壞了未免可惜。我們換個地方動手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鍛冶町。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那裡已經被你夷平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
